# Terraform state, plans, and provider caches
**/.terraform/
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfplan
**/*.plan
**/*.tfvars
**/*.tfvars.json
!**/*.tfvars.example

# Secrets and environment-specific configuration
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.local.json
**/config.local.js

# Python, test, and build output
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
coverage/
dist/
build/
*.zip

# Local operations evidence
.local-backups/
screenshots/
test-exports/

# Editors and operating systems
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
